Unknown: Do you have a teacup yet?

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:13.700
DM: No, I don't have a teacup.

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:14.040
Unknown: Oh, okay.

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:15.040
DM: Okay. Thank you.

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:15.260
Unknown: Yeah.

