00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:08.700
Unknown: Um, we'll talk about it.

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:11.020
Delwath: Like, what are you gonna do, punch it?

00:01:11.420 --> 00:01:11.700
Unknown: Right.

00:01:13.380 --> 00:01:13.520
Unknown: Um,

00:01:16.280 --> 00:01:22.180
Delwath: I'm feeling like Del- like the damage output from the Leviathan is pretty weak compared to Delwath's damage output.

00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:23.880
Unknown: So-

00:01:23.980 --> 00:01:25.380
DM: Um, thank you

00:01:25.380 --> 00:01:26.780
Unknown: ... it's nice from the like,

00:01:31.060 --> 00:01:33.660
