00:02:00.360 --> 00:02:00.640
Unknown: [dishes clanking]

00:02:00.660 --> 00:02:05.520
Wellby: Is it not that we need to do anything different than just dump a whole bunch of damage to get into the center?

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:05.940
Wellby: Like we...

00:02:08.220 --> 00:02:11.420
