Seeker: Well, [clears throat] I think I can swim through

00:02:17.380 --> 00:02:18.560
Unknown: to this direction.

00:02:20.020 --> 00:02:20.920
Unknown: So we'll have to test that.

00:02:24.960 --> 00:02:25.220
Unknown: I mean,

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:28.300
Unknown: possibly

00:02:29.320 --> 00:02:30.200
Unknown: the idea is that

00:02:34.860 --> 00:02:35.560
Unknown: everybody, uh,

00:02:38.700 --> 00:02:40.800
DM: fights it while Seeker tries to swim.

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:43.440
Delwath: Like we fight towards the thing, and Seeker tries to go

00:02:44.940 --> 00:02:46.400
Unknown: more into it and get the

00:02:47.220 --> 00:02:48.280
Unknown: whatever it's guarding.

00:02:49.340 --> 00:02:50.300
Unknown: Just retrieve it and then-

00:02:50.340 --> 00:02:51.040
Unknown: And retrieve it.

00:02:51.260 --> 00:02:51.540
Unknown: See if we can-

00:02:51.560 --> 00:02:53.220
