Unknown: Right

00:02:53.340 --> 00:02:54.040
Unknown: ... as Leviathan.

00:02:54.640 --> 00:02:55.420
Unknown: I like that.

00:02:57.580 --> 00:03:00.080
Kenzo: But we have to kill the thing in the middle, right?

00:03:00.920 --> 00:03:02.120
Unknown: Well, uh, is that...

