00:05:15.300 --> 00:05:15.440
Unknown: Right.

00:05:25.080 --> 00:05:25.440
Unknown: [dishes clanking]

00:05:25.440 --> 00:05:26.380
Unknown: But it's unclear,

00:05:27.480 --> 00:05:29.520
