00:06:19.592 --> 00:06:19.792
Unknown: Right.

00:06:19.792 --> 00:06:20.712
Unknown: It's probably, like...

00:06:21.232 --> 00:06:22.252
Unknown: It's more like an organ.

00:06:22.252 --> 00:06:24.092
